.venv/
venv/
*.pt
# The trained risk model is a ~5 KB deterministic artifact (fixed seeds in
# app/train.py). It IS committed so keyless cloud deploys serve a working model
# without a 250-epoch CPU training run at build time. Retrain with
# `cd services/risk-model && python -m app.train` and commit the result.
!services/risk-model/app/artifacts/.gitkeep
!services/risk-model/app/artifacts/risk_mlp.pt
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage/

